---
title: "getMemberStatus (stem-bot-v2: src/api/memberStatus.ts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate: discord_uid = req.query.discord_uid
    q_validate --> q_err_input: !discord_uid
    q_validate --> q_fetch: getMember(discord_uid)
    q_err_input --> [*]: res.status(400)
    q_fetch --> q_not_found: member is null
    q_fetch --> q_build_response: member found
    q_not_found --> [*]: res.json(is_in_server false)
    q_build_response --> q_respond: extract nickname, roles
    q_respond --> [*]: res.json(is_in_server true, nickname, roles)

    note right of q_validate
        INV-001: discord_uid is not sanitized before passing to Discord API
        INV-002: Any authenticated caller can check any members server presence
        INV-003: Role names are exposed in response (information disclosure)
    end note
